Fri Nov  6 08:46:55 UTC 2026 - John Paul Adrian Glaubitz <adrian.glaubitz@suse.com>

- Update to version 20261105.00
  * Move plugin manager OS-specific checks into per-OS source files.
  * Split config logging on the ini writer's own line break.
  * Refuse Windows account changes on Active Directory domain controllers.
  * Move the core plugin config file path into per-OS source files.
  * Send PLUGIN_CONFIG_REMOVE only when a plugin removal is requested.
  * Fix data races in guest agent plugin manager.
  * Reject path traversal and symlink entries in UnpackTargzFile.
  * Fix the MDS mTLS credentials directory permissions on Linux.
  * Add Network Telemetry Agent which collects diagnostic information
    which can be used to debug networking issues.
  * Add Network Telemetry Agent which collects diagnostic information
    which can be used to debug networking issues.
- Remove stale Go module version overrides in _service file

